{"5421220":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Domain Expansion","steam_appid":5421220,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"DOMAIN EXPANSION is a single-player 3D territory-capture game. Leave the boundary, draw a path, and reconnect safely to claim more of the board.<br \/>\r\n<br \/>\r\nChoose NORMAL or DEEP before each cut and balance risk against score. Watch out for enemies inside the board, enemies patrolling the boundary, timed acceleration, and territory eaters that take back captured ground.<br \/>\r\n<br \/>\r\nFeatures:<br \/>\r\n- 24 stages and a second loop with a higher capture target.<br \/>\r\n- An alternative way to clear certain stages: separate two interior enemies.<br \/>\r\n- Checkpoint continues and a local score ranking.<br \/>\r\n- Keyboard controls and adjustable resolution and display mode.","about_the_game":"DOMAIN EXPANSION is a single-player 3D territory-capture game. Leave the boundary, draw a path, and reconnect safely to claim more of the board.<br \/>\r\n<br \/>\r\nChoose NORMAL or DEEP before each cut and balance risk against score. Watch out for enemies inside the board, enemies patrolling the boundary, timed acceleration, and territory eaters that take back captured ground.<br \/>\r\n<br \/>\r\nFeatures:<br \/>\r\n- 24 stages and a second loop with a higher capture target.<br \/>\r\n- An alternative way to clear certain stages: separate two interior enemies.<br \/>\r\n- Checkpoint continues and a local score ranking.<br \/>\r\n- Keyboard controls and adjustable resolution and display mode.","short_description":"Draw lines and claim territory in a 3D arcade action game. Read enemy movements, choose between safer captures and bold DEEP cuts, and take on 24 stages followed by a tougher second loop.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5421220\/3f67443d1505ebaa85e8111698a3bb60e1b66519\/header.jpg?t=1793695309","capsule_im